    "title": "Ukrainian Forces Hold Positions Near Kupiansk, Halt Russian River Crossing Attempts - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago This article contains content summarized with AI. Learn more.\nvideo by @Kanal13AZ\nUkrainian forces have stopped Russian attempts to cross the Oskil River near Kupiansk by holding bridgeheads in the area. Military sources say fewer than 50 Russian soldiers are currently in the city. Ukrainian strikes have disrupted Russian supply lines and communication between Russian units.\nRussian troops have not made progress inside Kupiansk. As a result, they have shifted their attacks to the eastern outskirts and are targeting river crossings that remain under Ukrainian control. Ukrainian positions are holding, and engineering teams are repairing river crossings that have been damaged, despite continued Russian air and drone attacks.\n25",
